This project is provided "AS IS", without warranties or guarantees of any kind.

The original author is not responsible for damages, losses, misuse, or issues arising from the use, modification, or distribution of this software, to the extent permitted by applicable law.

Questions & Commercial Licensing

For commercial licensing, special permissions, partnerships, or other usage inquiries, please contact the original author through the contact information provided in this repository.

